# Nehir left-hand aliases — a/d mirror h/l for focus and move
# (docs/keybindings.md). Nehir can't express them: its hotkeys.toml codec maps
# one chord per action id, so a second chord has to come from outside.
#
# Absolute path — the skhd agent's launchd PATH has no Homebrew bin dir.
# skhdrc loads this whenever nehir is *enabled* and skhd grabs at the event-tap
# level regardless of which WM runs, so under another WM these four keys are
# dead rather than passed through.

alt - a : /Applications/Nehir.app/Contents/MacOS/nehirctl command focus left
alt - d : /Applications/Nehir.app/Contents/MacOS/nehirctl command focus right
shift + alt - a : /Applications/Nehir.app/Contents/MacOS/nehirctl command move left
shift + alt - d : /Applications/Nehir.app/Contents/MacOS/nehirctl command move right
